  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supply Chain Recovery for the Export of Grain from Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The immediate impact of this 9-month project will be the expansion of storage capacity at a critical time of harvest for smallholder producers of grain and oil seeds. FAO will provide polythene sleeves, loaders and unloaders as well as Mobile Storage Units in several Oblasts. The longer-term impact of the project will be continuing sustainability viability of grain and oil seed crop agriculture in Ukraine, sustaining global supplies and protecting the Ukrainian economy.</narrative>
  </description>
